    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max is horrified to learn that his sudden illness was caused by his recent dietary choices at the restaurant. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'to congratulate' and 'rash' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
